{{!
    @template tool_openapi/local/empty_state

    Shown in place of a table that has no rows yet. Included as a partial by
    the list templates, so an empty token list and an empty IP rule list look
    the same.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * emptymessage - Sentence explaining there is nothing here yet

    Example context (json):
    {
        "emptymessage": "No tokens yet."
    }
}}
<div class="text-center text-muted border rounded py-5 px-3">
    <p class="mb-0">{{emptymessage}}</p>
</div>
